  era: "Section 35 \xB7 Religion in India \xB7 Across the ages"
  title: Jainism in India today
  text: Jains are a small but influential community, known for ahimsa, vegetarianism, philanthropy and business. Temples at Palitana, Ranakpur and Dilwara, and the statue of Gommateshwara at Shravanabelagola are famous.
